%% WiFi Test Orchestrator architecture baseline 0.1.0
flowchart TB
    Server[Server HTTPS API]

    subgraph Agent[Agent boundary]
        Core[Agent Core]
        Delivery[Delivery Client]
        LocalQueue[(SQLite local queue)]
        Guard[Policy Guard]
        Runtime[Plugin Runtime]
        OS[OS or Mobile Adapter]
        Telemetry[Telemetry Collector]
        Time[Time Quality Estimator]
        Upload[Artifact Uploader]
        Credentials[Platform credential store]
    end

    Provider[Allowlisted provider]
    Network[Authorized test destination]

    Delivery -->|Outbound HTTPS| Server
    Server -->|HTTPS response| Delivery
    Delivery --> LocalQueue
    Delivery --> Credentials
    LocalQueue --> Guard
    Guard --> Core
    Core --> Runtime
    Core --> OS
    Runtime --> Provider
    Provider -->|Reserved traffic only| Network
    OS --> Telemetry
    Runtime --> Telemetry
    Time --> Telemetry
    Telemetry --> Delivery
    Runtime --> Upload
    Upload -->|Outbound HTTPS| Server
